## 4. State-Driven Navigation, Tabs & Cooperative Concurrency

- **DO** drive hierarchical navigation with `NavigationStack(path:)` (or `NavigationSplitView` for multi-column layouts) and value-based `NavigationLink(value:)` paired with `.navigationDestination(for:)`.
- **DO** drive modals with item-bound `.sheet(item:)` / `.fullScreenCover(item:)` / `.popover(item:)` rather than pairing `.sheet(isPresented:)` with a separate optional property.
- **DO** use the type-safe `Tab` API (`Tab("Title", systemImage: "icon", value: .tab)`) inside `TabView(selection:)` with `.tabViewStyle(.sidebarAdaptable)` for automatic iPad/macOS sidebar promotion and `Tab(value: .search, role: .search)` for integrated search tabs.
- **DO** connect card-to-detail transitions using `@Namespace` + `.matchedTransitionSource(id:in:)` on the source view and `.navigationTransition(.zoom(sourceID:in:))` on the destination view.
- **DO** bind async work to view lifecycles via `.task(id:)`, which automatically cancels the previous `Task` when the view disappears or `id` changes.
- **DON'T** use `NavigationView` or eager `NavigationLink(destination:)` (which instantiates destination views for every row upfront before the user taps).
- **DON'T** spawn unstructured `Task { ... }` inside `.onAppear` without storing and cancelling the handle, and **DON'T** run heavy filtering/sorting inside `body`.

```swift
struct CatalogSplitView: View {
    @Namespace private var zoomNamespace
    @State private var selectedTab: AppTab = .explore
    @State private var searchText = ""

    var body: some View {
        TabView(selection: $selectedTab) {
            Tab("Explore", systemImage: "sparkles", value: .explore) {
                NavigationStack {
                    ScrollView {
                        LazyVGrid(columns: [GridItem(.adaptive(minimum: 160), spacing: 16)]) {
                            ForEach(sampleItems) { item in
                                NavigationLink(value: item) {
                                    ItemTileView(item: item)
                                }
                                .matchedTransitionSource(id: item.id, in: zoomNamespace)
                            }
                        }
                        .padding()
                    }
                    .navigationDestination(for: CatalogItem.self) { item in
                        ItemDetailView(item: item)
                            .navigationTransition(.zoom(sourceID: item.id, in: zoomNamespace))
                    }
                }
            }
            Tab(value: .search, role: .search) {
                NavigationStack {
                    SearchResultsView(query: searchText)
                        .searchable(text: $searchText)
                }
            }
        }
        .tabViewStyle(.sidebarAdaptable)
    }
}
```

